{"t": 1793318247749, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "after3", "Tick 3728: after Peace with Whitewood (accepted, truce 60 s, envoy sent) the rows re-sorted again with the screen open: Whitewood dropped from row 1 to row 2 and Southernport rose to row 1. My next click, aimed at Southernport's Tribute in row 2, hit Whitewood ('Your envoy to Whitewood is still on the road'). Then Ally to Castleton at +9 was refused and sent no envoy: the following Tribute to Castleton went through at once (+19, envoy back in 20 s). Per-nation envoys confirmed: Whitewood and Castleton away, Southernport free."]}
