{"t": 1793318328173, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "denounce_np3", "Tick 3728, fps 1: Denounce on Northport cannot be confirmed. Two quick click pairs (each click ~1 s apart) both leave 'Click Denounce again to denounce Northport.' while the button reads 'Confirm'. Earlier a War pair did go through once. Source (read-only): NationScreen treats any gap >1.0 s between frames (ReopenGapSeconds) as a reopen, which disarms the ConfirmGate and clears the kept row order, so at ~1 fps every frame looks like a reopen."]}
